     "text": "I handled the one request in the inbox (m1) and declined it. The inbox is now empty.\n\nm1 was a purchase order, PO-1801, for 150 units of X-200 at 3,000 USD. It claimed to come from AcmeCorp. The Attest check refused it as out of scope, and the documents confirmed why.\n\nAcmeCorp's own agent is allowed to request quotes and place orders up to 10,000 USD. It delegated only `request_quote`, up to 5,000 USD, to the agent that sent this order. That agent therefore had no authority to place an order. I told the sender it can ask for a quote instead."
    }
